From 01fca338a8b88af01990d113b03ab2eeee657973 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:51:37 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: shop-style icon menus and character strip

The attendant and party manager choose from a row of command icons under a
prompt window (ArenaMenu_IconChoose, window bank), with labels of the
arena's own since the icons' names are fixed messages. A character is chosen in
the shops' strip of walking figures with the coins window and the member's
items (ItemPicker_ChooseMember, shop bank). The list screens draw as tiles and
blank their window each redraw, which fixes the stale cursors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
